  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So If your like me an got that hecking final IK script, well I've got news for you! If you were having issues with any limiters on your IK's, It might be because some of them seem to be not whitelisted. They already seem safe enough, it IS the final IK scripts after all. (and like I have a couple of avatar plans that revolve around this angle limiter to work, so like, i mean I would be greatful for a whitelist)\n\nThe avatars that depend on this is Wall-e (hands and legs), Eve (hands) and a Drone on one hand with a second drone inside, that is deployed with an IK script that connects it to the other hand. Oh and also arms on my bartender robot would be more reliable and dang old fix. (did you know you can keyframe the angle limits, so you can sudo disable and enable the IK scripts if these scripts are whitelisted) If you do robots, awesome Ik animated technology or got any cool multi limbed creatures or the like, then this would be a great addition to the whitelist!",
